"Without going to the Trash, where the app can, like Delete Immediately in Finder. Off, Shift-Delete is left as it is." = "Sense passar per la Paperera, on l'app ho permet, com Eliminar immediatament al Finder. Desactivat, Maj-Suprimir es queda com està.";
"Without it, Auto Quit can't do anything." = "Sense aquest permís, Tancament automàtic no pot fer res.";
"Without it, Delete to Trash can't do anything." = "Sense ell, Eliminar a la Paperera no pot fer res.";
"Without it, Dock Preview can't do anything." = "Sense aquest permís, la Previsualització del Dock no pot fer res.";
"Without it, each window shows its app's icon instead of a thumbnail." = "Sense aquest permís, cada finestra mostra la icona de la seva app en lloc d'una miniatura.";
"Without it, Focus Follows Mouse can't do anything." = "Sense aquest permís, Focus sota el punter no pot fer res.";
"Without it, key-to-key mappings still work (picked from the list); mouse buttons, system actions, recording by pressing and the Event Viewer don't." = "Sense aquest permís, els mapatges de tecla a tecla continuen funcionant (triats de la llista); els botons del ratolí, les accions del sistema, gravar prement i el Visor d'esdeveniments no.";
"Without it, macOS's own loupe is used, and the color shows once copied." = "Sense aquest permís, es fa servir la lupa de macOS, i el color es mostra un cop copiat.";
"Without it, Middle Click can't do anything." = "Sense aquest permís, Clic central no pot fer res.";
"Without it, the history still records, and picking an entry copies it to paste yourself with ⌘V." = "Sense aquest permís, l'historial es continua desant, i triar una entrada la copia perquè l'enganxis tu amb ⌘V.";
"Without it, the output and the microphone still work, but not each app's sound." = "Sense aquest permís, la sortida i el micròfon continuen funcionant, però no el so de cada app.";
"Without it, Window Snapping can't do anything." = "Sense aquest permís, Ajust de finestres no pot fer res.";
"§ (Section)" = "§ (Secció)";
"Works in apps with a command on ⌘⌫ in their menus, like Move to Trash or Delete. While typing, Delete deletes text as usual. Holding it down deletes once. In Finder's Trash, it deletes immediately." = "Funciona a les apps amb una ordre a ⌘⌫ als seus menús, com Traslladar a la Paperera o Eliminar. Mentre escrius, Suprimir esborra text com sempre. Si la mantens premuda, elimina un sol cop. A la Paperera del Finder, elimina a l'instant.";
